[[Aetheric Anchor]] is a [[Legendary weapon|legendary]] [[container]] added with [[Guild Wars 2: Visions of Eternity|Visions of Eternity]]. It contains both the [[Legendary]] [[Spear]] and [[Legendary]] [[Staff]] forms of [[Ancora]], {{item icon|Ancora Bellum}}, and {{item icon|Ancora Pax}}.

== Lore ==
{{main|Ancora}}

== Acquisition ==
=== Recipe ===
{{Recipe
| source = Mystic Forge
| ingredient1 = 1 Gift of the Survivors
| ingredient2 = 1 Gift of the People
| ingredient3 = 1 Gift of Insight
| ingredient4 = 1 Gift of the Elders
}}

== Contents ==
* {{Contains|Ancora Bellum|chance=guaranteed}}
* {{Contains|Ancora Pax|chance=guaranteed}}

